es":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"oe-iacnzvyHV8zxaNqCf7A","review_id":"pz9ixe1VUHI_aRKxy_vgcw","date":"2020-07-18T21:45:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9337104558944702,"text_excerpt":"My boyfriend and I recently dined here and it was clean and we felt safe. Staff wore masks, seating was spaced out. Drinks were very good. I had the Bloody Mary and he had the sazerac. The Bloody Mary had a good kick to it. We started off with half a dozen raw oysters and fried pickles. The fried pickles were my absolute fave. Oysters were good but not the best I've ever had in NOLA. For entrees we shared the blackened redfish and fried seafood platter. Portions were huge. Menu was limited, I think due to COVID. I really wanted to try the bacon jam burger but that wasn't available. I'll have to come back next time that's available."},{"business_id":"oe-iacnzvyHV8zxaNqCf7A","review_id":"GmfLbjKY4c2r-pKrSzra6A","date":"2019-06-11T23:27:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9316909313201904,"text_excerpt":"This place was highly recommended to us by the hotel concierge and two different tour guides. The food was excellent and served hot and fresh. Portions were generous. We had 3 different appetizers- oyster trio prepared 3 different ways, Cajun egg rolls and Boudain balls. My husband thought it was the best Boudain we have had on our trip so far. My favorite was the Beinville oysters. Price comparable to area. Atmosphere lively. 2 separate bar areas. We were here for happy hour drink specials. My husband had a Bloody Mary and an oyster shooter. We arrived way before the dinner crowd started. I gave them 4 instead of 5 stars for a few reasons. The restrooms were messy with no tissue in the l..."},{"business_id":"oe-iacnzvyHV8zxaNqCf7A","review_id":"i1jgLarNI2iqlt0s8YCRew","date":"2019-11-05T20:41:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9299595355987549,"text_excerpt":"Ate here for dinner with a group of 6. Place is a bit small for a larger group, but they were very accommodating. The plain oysters were some of the freshest I've ever had. I had the jambalaya and gumbo and they were fantastic, full of flavor with the right amount of spice. Everyone else enjoyed their meals also. Would definitely come back."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"oe-iacnzvyHV8zxaNqCf7A","photo_id":"i378kxQeFiXMTgXXlVRn-A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/i378kxQeFiXMTgXXlVRn-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8810673952102661},{"business_id":"oe-iacnzvyHV8zxaNqCf7A","photo_id":"vz2A3LDXX8HsxBuxFeQ_OQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/vz2A3LDXX8HsxBuxFeQ_OQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8792803287506104},{"business_id":"oe-iacnzvyHV8zxaNqCf7A","photo_id":"-HE7gvFeCVwF3DUtNJ-KEg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-HE7gvFeCVwF3DUtNJ-KEg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8658552169799805},{"business_id":"oe-iacnzvyHV8zxaNqCf7A","photo_id":"GIbp6pL6pYvJNGHWvxV6bA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GIbp6pL6pYvJNGHWvxV6bA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8137453198432922},{"business_id":"oe-iacnzvyHV8zxaNqCf7A","photo_id":"r859c8Ecs2